findings.suggestion:
Remove the empty fallback to force an explicit failure if the env var is absent:
  app.super-admin.password=${SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD}
Alternatively, keep the empty default but add startup validation in SuperAdminSeeder: if `SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL` is non-blank and `SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD` is blank, log an error and skip seeding (or throw to prevent startup in non-dev environments).
